---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Legal notice: who runs this German tenancy website" description="Legal notice (Impressum) under Section 5 DDG and Section 18 MStV: who operates this site on German rent indexes, the rent brake and service charges, who is responsible and the host." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Legal notice</h1>
    <p>Information under Section 5 of the German Digital Services Act (DDG) for {SITE_URL}. German law calls this page the Impressum.</p>
    <h2>Provider</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <h2>Responsible for content under Section 18(2) MStV</h2>
    <p>{AUTHOR_NAME}, address as above, reachable at <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>What the site is, and is not</h2>
    <p>The site explains German residential tenancy law, the rent indexes of the large cities and the states' tenant-protection ordinances, in German and English, and offers calculators that apply these rules. It is independent and not connected to any city, state government, tenant or landlord association, property manager, law firm or legal-tech company. Results are general calculations, not legal advice on an individual case and not a review of any lease or letter. Only court decisions and the legal texts in force are binding. See the <a href={route('method', lang)}>method page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Liability for content and links</h2>
    <p>We check the legal values whenever the rules change and run automated tests before each release, but cannot guarantee the absence of errors. Operators of linked external sites are responsible for their content; links to legal texts lead to official federal and state services. Please report errors through the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Embedding the calculator</h2>
    <p>The rent check may be embedded free of charge by iframe as long as the source link stays visible: <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed the calculator</a>.</p>
    <h2>Dispute resolution</h2>
    <p>We are neither willing nor obliged to take part in proceedings before a consumer arbitration board. Data protection: see the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a>. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
